Z||000001||Fierowrecker||12-09-2001||04:14 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by KillerX:<BR><B>ok i was gonna do the diagnosic test on my 85 GT 4 speed fiero until i say there was no check engine light! (the very bottom right) how do i repleace it (please say i only have to replace the light!) can sum1 give me detailed instuctions on how to install it? thanX</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Remove the TOP half of the cluster housing, reach down and remove the quarter turn socket, remove the bulb and test it...<BR>If it is good, bend the metal contacts out and reinstall it, test and see if it works...<BR>If it is bad, replace it AND bend out the contacts, replace it and see if it works...<BR>crash...||||reg||1
